{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"36829","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v35894","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"壱川 ひゅろ","creatorId":"vndb:s17616","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17616","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17616","name":"壱川 ひゅろ","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:184815","source":"vndb"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"壱川 ひゅろ","creatorId":"vndb:s17616","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17616","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17616","name":"壱川 ひゅろ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:184814","source":"vndb"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c138884","characterName":"コンラント","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c138884"},"originalCharacterName":"コンラント","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The older brother of the protagonist. After the death of his father, the former king, Conrad was forced to join the Royal Order of Knights to guard the borders of the kingdom at the risk of his life when he was still young. He honestly serves in his post with sheer conviction and doesn't care what happens to himself, but shows concern only when it concerns his sister who is friendless. He is so overprotective that he secretly checks with those around him to see if there is anything unusual. He is serious, sincere, and a little clumsy. He takes pride and dignity in being a knight and is always dignified, but he is also somewhat elusive and dangerous."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has no experience with women."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from DLSite."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138884"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c0702a9053f2b657a9e30a8f520bb8923b2a7940e57cb548cdeba2b027a8a02.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f2a8083a4caec4c16a5921ef0f919e827c1df6f9b65f5684cfaff337c798d1f.webp","width":244,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一条 ひらめ","creatorId":"vndb:s23795","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23795","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23795","name":"一条 ひらめ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:91213","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c138885","characterName":"クラリス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c138885"},"originalCharacterName":"クラリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Clarisse was orphaned from a young age-- with her father having died when she was very young, and her mother dying just after she was born. Due to this absence of maternity in her life, she hungers for the mere concept of motherhood. She loves her brother Conrad, her only living relative, but due to the poor circumstances of her emotional life while growing up, her attachment to him has warped over time. She is a pessimistic person and she never expects anything, but always starts with resignation. She is usually ladylike and calm, but sometimes she becomes emotionally unstable and fiercely desires her brother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from DLSite."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138885"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b24c62a4d2c2d7289b70e7843b16feef219c5519493c2771ad96c0694e5635e8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-a